  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7c5b4f13a1387a18ae82d5885885ce84, type: 3}
  m_Name: T-01
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: TahaYasin.Runtime::DispatchScenarioData
  scenarioId: T-01
  readyForPlay: 1
  callerName: Murat
  callerLocation: Bodrum sahili
  emergencyType: Tsunami uyarısı
  situationSummary: Deniz hızla çekildi; sahilde kalabalık var.
  sourceNotes: "Kaynak: kullan\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n 17.10.2026 tarihli k\u0131sa senaryo metni. Yaln\u0131zca konu\u015fmalar ve se\u00e7enekler g\u00fcncellendi; oyun kurallar\u0131 korundu."
  opening:
  - text: "Operat\u00f6r: 912 Acil, dinliyorum."
    fromOperator: 1
  - text: "KAZAZEDE: Murat ben, Bodrum sahilindeyiz. Az \u00f6nce a\u00e7\u0131k denizde deprem oldu ama \u015fimdi deniz en az 100 metre geri \u00e7ekildi!"
    fromOperator: 0
  - text: "Operat\u00f6r: Murat Bey, sahil arama kurtarma ekibimize anons ge\u00e7tim. Deniz h\u0131zla m\u0131 \u00e7ekildi?"
    fromOperator: 1
  - text: "Murat: Evet, kumsalda y\u00fczlerce \u00e7\u0131rp\u0131nan bal\u0131k kald\u0131! B\u00fct\u00fcn millet bal\u0131k toplamaya kumsala ko\u015fuyor, video \u00e7ekiyor!"
    fromOperator: 0
  - text: "Murat: Biz de kumsala iniyoruz foto\u011fraf \u00e7ekmeye, inelim de\u011fil mi?"
    fromOperator: 0
  choiceA: "Foto\u011fraf \u00e7ekebilirsiniz ama fazla a\u00e7\u0131lmay\u0131n, deniz seviyesine bak\u0131n."
  choiceB: "TSUNAM\u0130 GEL\u0130YOR! DERHAL SAH\u0130L\u0130 BO\u015eALTIP EN AZ 30 METRE Y\u00dcKSEK TEPELERE KO\u015eUN!"
  correctChoiceIsB: 1
  resourceA: 2
  resourceB: 2
  dispatchA: 1
  dispatchB: 1
  outcomeA:
  - text: "Murat: \u0130ndik kumsala... O da ne? Ufukta dev bir duvar gibi y\u00fckseliyor su! OHA DALGA GEL\u0130YOR! DUVAR G\u0130B\u0130 GEL\u0130YOR! KA\u00c7I---"
    fromOperator: 0
  outcomeB:
  - text: "Operat\u00f6r: Murat Bey o TSUNAM\u0130! \u00c7ekilen su dev dalga olarak d\u00f6necek! Avaz\u0131n\u0131z \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131\u011f\u0131 kadar ba\u011f\u0131r\u0131n, herkes tepeye ko\u015fsun!"
    fromOperator: 1
  - text: "Murat: KA\u00c7IN! TSUNAM\u0130 GEL\u0130YOR D\u0130YOR 112!! Tepeye \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131k... Dalga kumsal\u0131 komple yuttu! Arama kurtarma ekibiniz insanlar\u0131 tepeye y\u00f6nlendiriyor."
    fromOperator: 0
